# INVWINDL.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: at level 1 an
# item of the split view's contents cannot be dragged.  A press on it
# moved onto Box B2 starts no drag and marks no row, and its release
# there moves nothing and shows no box.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINDL.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/dragchk.py checks
# it.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER ALT-L B
S LOCS
M 221.1 DOWN ROW 0
M 221.1 MOVE ROW 0 8 0
M 208.1 MOVE ROW 2
S L1OVER
M 208.1 UP ROW 2
S L1UP
K ALT-F X
